  "worked_solution": "First, notice that \n\n$$\n\\text{Area}(D)=1\\cdot 3=3.\n$$\n\nApplying the average value formula, we find that the average value of the function is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{\\text{ave}} & =\\frac{1}{\\text{Area}(D)}\\,{\u222c}_{D}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\u222c}_{D}({x}^{2}+3{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}({x}^{2}+3{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{3}[{x}^{2}y+{y}^{3}]_{y=0}^{y=1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{3}({x}^{2}+1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+x]_{x=0}^{x=3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(\\frac{{3}^{3}}{3}+3) \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
